prompts/judging-v8.txt\n?? src/hivemind/views/links.py\n?? tests/test_links.py\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:10:## 0. What it decides, and what it can reach\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:22:## 1. Arms (paired by draw n = 1, 2, 3)\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:41:## 2. Harness rules (July's, `dependency-design/july_test.py`, extended to the window)\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:53:## 3. The $0 proofs before the send\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:71:## 4. Reading rule (frozen before the send)\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:164:## 5. Cost (estimate; the ceiling is Alex's)\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:172:## 6. Time\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:177:## 7. Round 22 findings and where they are answered\ndocs/research/2026-11-21-whole-window/PAID-DESIGN.md:201:## 8. Staged send (D708, council round 31)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:12:## 0. Checklist before every start (Alex: \"每次开始前都需要revisit\")\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:25:## 1. Goal (end to end)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:31:## 2. The core blocker (proven)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:57:## 3. Ruled out or secondary (outside this phase's scope, each recorded separately)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:70:## 4. Constraints (what must not move, and why)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:93:## 5. What to do\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:120:## 6. How to measure (the ruler does not move; the method does not change again)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:168:## 7. Process (no drift)\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:179:## 8. Steps and where we are\ndocs/prd/10-filing-phase.md:193:## 9. Alex's own words on this matter (in time order)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
